                                        "entry_id": "c6a40a62-def6-3686-88d1-e0ae6de92cce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Effectual or important."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b1e6e4e-33cc-47d4-95ee-e813d7cff0bf",
                                                "sense_id": "39ffcf2a-8f60-3e96-af38-137b3ace9b6a",
                                                "text": "He's usually in a good mood — the operative word there being \"usually\". Today was a disaster."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16e4c527-130f-304f-ae8b-16c22463e083",
                                        "entry_id": "c6a40a62-def6-3686-88d1-e0ae6de92cce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Functional, in working order."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d37712b-936f-36c0-9eb4-a120f8933615",
                                        "entry_id": "c6a40a62-def6-3686-88d1-e0ae6de92cce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the power of acting; hence, exerting force, physical or moral; active in the production of effects."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44910039-b02e-4f6f-9386-df3d81563a8e",
                                                "sense_id": "1d37712b-936f-36c0-9eb4-a120f8933615",
                                                "text": "an operative motive"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40e0dcf2-a52e-42bf-a10c-66a2746a168e",
                                                "sense_id": "1d37712b-936f-36c0-9eb4-a120f8933615",
                                                "text": "It holds in all operative principles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b730a656-516c-4729-bba0-c6684b0f6f6c",
                                                "sense_id": "1d37712b-936f-36c0-9eb4-a120f8933615",
                                                "text": "This call is operative not merely on the level of abstract theory."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31f8c3d7-09bd-3936-8aef-5a5fe2957df7",
                                        "entry_id": "c6a40a62-def6-3686-88d1-e0ae6de92cce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Producing the appropriate or designed effect; efficacious."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1efa5033-7927-432a-941a-8f76937addad",
                                                "sense_id": "31f8c3d7-09bd-3936-8aef-5a5fe2957df7",
                                                "text": "an operative dose, rule, or penalty"
